    "Implement load-generators as lightweight standalone Java applications reusing existing Spring XD test utilities for consistency.",
    "Upgrade Kafka client dependency to 0.8.2 in the project build configuration and adapt any changed APIs.",
    "For stateful stream processing (U8), produce only a design proposal document; native implementation is out of scope for this increment.",
